\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ### The Rebrand (Mid-2023)\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - Up World was born from a full rebrand of **The Copy Club** in **July 2023**.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - A holding page went live at [up-world.co](https://up-world.co) on **20th July 2023**, with the full site launching on **25th July 2023**.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - The rebrand involved a complete overhaul: new domain, new logo, email signatures, TeamTailor templates, HubSpot automations, LinkedIn profiles, and Canva templates.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - The #team-up-world Slack channel was created on **12th July 2023** \'97 the first time the business had a dedicated cross-functional team channel for the new brand.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - Key insight from this period: transitioning from 'Copy Club' to 'Up World' created widespread confusion that has **never been fully resolved** \'97 members continued to be confused about the relationship between Up World, Up Club, Match Makers (formerly Match Making), and later Big Up Club. Lottie flagged in November 2024: *"This has always been a huge problem for us since our re-brand last year."*\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - A strategy deck to address Up World vs Up Club clarity was commissioned in late 2024 but implementation remained partial.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - The brand previously operated under **Copy Club** with its own community Slack, community membership, and recruitment arm. The rebrand unified these under one "Up World" master brand.\cb1 \
